```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "read the normalize law over named carriers; drift exits 1"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.meme.checks", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.meme.checks"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.meme.checks"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.meme.checks ~ the normalize law read alone, or a sibling reading

`lares meme check <file.mem…>` reads the normalize law over each named carrier and writes nothing; any drift exits 1, the reading CI and the pre-commit hook run. `format=problems` prints one `path:line:col: severity: code: message` line per diagnostic for a problem matcher. `gradient=true`, `edges=true` and `sitting=true` read a sibling survey in the law's place (a file the flag ate as its value still counts as named), and none rides beside `format=problems`. `grammar=true` reads the grammar clauses too.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ check · problems · gradient

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`check` params=`files/draft.mem ~ read the law over one carrier`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`problems` params=`files/draft.mem format/problems ~ one matcher line per diagnostic`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`gradient` params=`files/draft.mem gradient/true ~ the gradient survey`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ files · format · gradient · edges · sitting · grammar

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`files` params=`takes/host-paths needs/required seat/1 as/<file.mem…> ~ the carriers to read, every word past the verb`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`format` params=`takes/word ~ problems, the one format this door reads`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`gradient` params=`kind/switch ~ the gradient survey in the law's place`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`edges` params=`kind/switch ~ the edge survey in the law's place`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sitting` params=`kind/switch ~ the sitting survey in the law's place`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`grammar` params=`kind/switch ~ read the grammar-authority clauses too`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads host files with no daemon in reach; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.meme.checks files/draft.mem]] ~ no carrier named, an unreadable file, a format other than problems, or a survey beside format=problems`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ canonical · drifted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`canonical` params=`exit/0 ~ every named carrier stands canonical`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`drifted` params=`exit/1 ~ a carrier drifted; each names its clause`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares meme check

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares meme check]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

